From: Tim Douglas <me@timdoug.com>
Subject: [PATCH] bfd: add the Seiko Epson C33

The architecture (bfd_arch_c33), its relocations and the c33_elf32_vec
and c33_elf32_fdpic_vec vectors.  cpu-c33.c and elf32-c33.c are
the port's own files.

The generated Makefile.in, configure, bfd-in2.h and libbfd.h carry the matching hunks, edited by hand rather
than regenerated; a submission regenerates them with automake 1.15.1, autoconf 2.69
and make headers.

Signed-off-by: Tim Douglas <me@timdoug.com>

