+  Seiko Epson C33 (S1C33 family) relocations.  The H/M/L and
+  RH/RM/RL families split a 32-bit value across the multiple
+  immediate fields produced by the "ext" prefix mechanism; the
+  G/S/T/Z variants are relative to the global, small, tiny and
+  zero data area base registers respectively.
